# The eUPF data plane needs these capabilities (NET_ADMIN,
# SYS_RESOURCE, BPF, PERFMON, DAC_OVERRIDE) to load eBPF programs, pin maps
# under bpffs and raise RLIMIT_MEMLOCK - a restricted security context is
# not supported by design.
AVD-KSV-0118

# The eUPF data plane needs a /sys/fs/bpf hostPath mount to pin eBPF maps. A "disallowed volume type" (hostPath) is by design here.
AVD-KSV-0121
